msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Attention : le dossier temporaire n'a pas pu être supprimé en entier. Il contient des données en clair : effacez le contenu de ~/.cache/sauvegarde-bureau."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Warning: the temporary folder could not be fully deleted. It contains unencrypted data: delete the contents of ~/.cache/sauvegarde-bureau."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Certaines étapes ont signalé des erreurs : vous pouvez les relancer depuis la page « Restaurer »."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Some steps reported errors: you can run them again from the \"Restore\" page."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Comparaison faite chez le service : rien n'a été téléchargé."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"The comparison was done on the service's side: nothing was downloaded."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Extensions, réglages et nouvelles applications ne sont pleinement pris en compte qu'à la prochaine ouverture de session. Enregistrez vos documents ouverts avant de fermer la session."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Extensions, settings and new applications are only fully applied the next time you log in. Save your open documents before closing the session."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"L'estimation est prudente : l'archive est compressée et pourrait occuper moins de place. Sans assez de place, la sauvegarde risque pourtant d'échouer en cours de route."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"The estimate is conservative: the archive is compressed and may take up less space. Without enough space, the backup may still fail partway through."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Le fichier n'a pas été modifié ni abîmé. Le mot de passe, lui, n'est pas encore testé : le bouton « Tester le mot de passe… » le vérifie sans rien restaurer."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"The file has not been modified or damaged. The password, however, has not been tested yet: the \"Test password…\" button checks it without restoring anything."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Le mot de passe des archives n'est pas testé : activez « Tester aussi le mot de passe » pour le vérifier sans rien restaurer."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"The archives' password has not been tested: turn on \"Also test the password\" to check it without restoring anything."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Libérez de la place, choisissez un autre emplacement ou décochez un élément volumineux."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Free up some space, choose another location or untick a large item."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Mot de passe correct pour {n} archive (le début a été déchiffré, rien n'a été restauré)."
msgid_plural ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Mot de passe correct pour {n} archives (le début a été déchiffré, rien n'a été restauré)."
msgstr[0] ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Correct password for {n} archive (the beginning was decrypted, nothing was restored)."
msgstr[1] ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Correct password for {n} archives (the beginning was decrypted, nothing was restored)."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Sans assez de place, la sauvegarde échouera en cours de route."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Without enough space, the backup will fail partway through."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Vérifiez que le dossier n'est pas protégé en écriture ni utilisé par un autre programme."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Check that the folder is not write-protected or in use by another program."

msgid ""
"\n"
"… et {v1} autres"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"… and {v1} more"

msgid "  echo 'Installation groupée échouée, essai paquet par paquet…'"
msgstr "  echo 'Bulk install failed, trying package by package…'"

msgid ""
"  while read -r p; do apt-get install -y \"$p\" || echo \"Échec apt : $p\"; "
"done < {q}"
msgstr ""
"  while read -r p; do apt-get install -y \"$p\" || echo \"apt failed: $p\"; "
"done < {q}"

